		{
			title: "A Way In"
			icon: "tfb2:shipping_crate_empty"
			x: -8.25d
			y: -1.25d
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "Where to begin..."
			description: [
				"&dOkay Bandit, I've been pondering how we can start utilizing that 'pipe' we installed into their system. Piping out items and putting them back in with the Worm is only going to get us so far..."
				""
				"&5Especially if they find it and we don't have more ways in, yeah?"
				""
				"&dExactly. We could install some backdoors but... thats the first thing they'll look if the pipe is found."
				""
				"&5So you figured something out, sis?"
				""
				"&dYep. We start to destabilize the system from the inside. If we start poking holes inside the system, then it becomes easier to open new holes."
				""
				"&5Hopefully more than they fix."
				""
				"&dWon't know for sure till we try. Bandit, send us a Pouch in a Shipping Crate. I think you'll like this idea..."
			]
			dependencies: [
				"232779928B96328E"
				"50D9EFE8ABEA9779"
				"0AF2E388B45934CC"
				"4342B9F453AD1F1B"
