		{
			title: "...A Little Rummaging..."
			icon: {
				id: "the_vault:booster_pack"
				Count: 1b
				tag: {
					id: "vhapi:hacked_pack"
				}
			}
			x: -6.25d
			y: -1.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Stacking the Deck"
			description: [
				"&dSo, Bandit, what I just gave you is called a Card Deck. Kind of."
				""
				"&5Wait, I read that was a mid-game mechanic they recently added?"
				""
				"&dMmm yep, its a wonderful idea. Collect cards, equip them, and do the tasks while inside vaults to get even more rewards. It's also buggy as all get."
				""
				"&5Ah, I see. A weak spot, not bad."
				""
				"&dRight you are bro. So Bandit, if you hold and Right Click that, you'll open up a hacked together Card Deck."
				""
				"&5Bandit'll need some Cards, too."
				""
				"&dYep. Take a card and Booster Pack, Bandit. I was able to modify the Card system with our own cards. Hold and Right Click that Booster Pack to get a random card, then put both into your Deck and equip that. Then run Vaults till you complete an Objective."
			]
			dependencies: ["69C663CDD23190A9"]
			id: "5FC0C65E68336246"
			tasks: [{
				id: "2A26065803FF5667"
				type: "checkmark"
				title: "Staying Out of the Kitchen"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Glitched Out"
			icon: "tfb2:glitched_ingot"
			x: -4.0d
			y: -1.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "Not Quite Right"
			description: [
				"&dYes yes, there we go! Okay, when you complete a Vault Objective, and you've fulfilled a condition on one of those cards, you should get some extra items in that Completion Crate."
				""
				"&5Oh I see. Hiding the contraband in their own reward system. Not bad, sis."
				""
				"&dThats only step one, brother. Step two is... a bit of luck. See, those hacked Cards? They'll pull resources from the deepest parts of their storage. The stuff on old servers, old versions, that isn't quite right. And with any luck..."
				""
				"&5...Bandit will get some junk back?"
				""
				"&dNot just any junk. Glitched junk. Glitchy, broken items. We can use these, so send us, say, 5 of them? To start with at least. And 5 of those Glitched Blocks as well. We'll need a lot of them if this works..."
			]
			dependencies: ["5FC0C65E68336246"]
