			}]
		}
		{
			title: "In The Soul Market"
			x: -4.0d
			y: -3.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Spend Wisely"
			description: [
				"&dThe Black Market is a way for you to obtain items and materials that can help you in the Vaults. The cost? Soul Shards, which it can pull directly from your Soul Pouch."
				""
				"&5It sells equipment, resources, and other such things. But only three items at a time..."
				""
				"&d...well, and a Random Item option at a fixed price."
				""
				"&5The items vary in price, but the middle slot is highlighted in purple, and considered a Good Deal almost always."
				""
				"&dThere's also some items that will ONLY show up in this special slot, so keep an eye on it!"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["287AFB08CA4CC848"]
			id: "7913E52AAC8DE521"
			tasks: [{
				id: "695A56A69F3C677C"
				type: "item"
				item: "the_vault:black_market"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Crystal Customization"
			x: -2.5d
			y: -2.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Have It Your Way"
			description: [
				"&dSo while this might be quite expensive to start with, Bandit, you'll want to get one of these up and running."
				""
				"&5Called a Crystal Workbench. The Black Chromatic Steel is expensive, but Pillaging those Braziers can net ya an early one."
				""
				"&dYou'll need it to Modify those Vault Crystals you make. You can't modify much in the early level, but..."
				""
				"&5That Seal you got from us is one way to modify yer crystals. That'll lock in what objective the Vault has."
				""
				"&dGood for both of us since I think we'll need to use the specific objectives to crack the system more. But yeah, your crystals at low level can't be modified too much. That's Capacity, which goes up as you level."
				""
				"&5There's a bunch of different things you can do to a Crystal. Capstones, Themes, etc. Real interesting."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["76B7D44E338DC9B7"]
