		{
			title: "Artisinal Gear"
			icon: "the_vault:vault_artisan_station"
			x: -4.0d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Rolled Perfect"
			description: [
				"&dVault Gear you find in the Vault will be at that Vault's level (not your own)."
				""
				"&5Gear found with the Market will be at your level; and Bounties have their own level as well."
				""
				"&dUnidentified gear only has Level and minimum rarity stats until you roll it. These stats you can alter with the Vault Artisan Station."
				""
				"&5Using various Focus...Foci? Focuses?"
				""
				"&dFocus like the Wild Focus, you can reroll different aspects of a gear piece for the cost of some Vault Bronze and Vault Plating."
				""
				"&5What kind of gear determines what kind of Implicits (the set attributes of a piece), and Suffixes and Prefixes (additional attributes) it can have."
				""
				"&dThe rarity of the gear determines how many Prefix and Suffix slots it has. The rarer, the more slots."
