		{
			title: "Quite Magnetizing"
			x: -14.0d
			y: -1.25d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "An Attractive Personality"
			description: [
				"&dOne piece of Vault Gear you might not have yet is the Magnet."
				""
				"&5Quite a useful piece of gear for looting, especially. Any items dropped nearby fly right to you to pick up."
				""
				"&dYou can make one in the Vault Forge if you haven't gotten one from looting yet, Bandit. They can have some useful abilities on them."
				""
				"&5I especially like Endergized. Its the power of the Endermen, and just teleports the items into your inventory, no flying around or anything."
				""
				"&dWatch the durability though, Bandit. More loot means more durability loss."
			]
