		{
			title: "Becoming an Expert"
			icon: "woldsvaults:expertise_orb"
			x: 4.25d
			y: 1.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Smart Strength"
			description: [
				"&dYou've most likely already hit Level 5, Bandit, so you probably already noticed you gained an Expertise Point."
				""
				"&5Unlike Skills, these are more... indirect buffs to a User, usually involving things not directly combat or looting related."
				""
				"&dThings like improving your Black Market or Bounty Tables. Hm, I also see something about Expertise Orbs in the code, one minute..."
				""
				"&5What did you find, sis?"
				""
				"&d...let me just try...Damn. Okay, looks like Expertise points are hard locked to one every 5 levels. But there's an Expertise Orb in the system, just not quite obtainable. I was about to 'hack' up one to test it, but the system fixed the hole fast. Here, you hold onto this for now, Bandit."
				""
				"&5We'll see if we can find a way to...break the Expertise system later."
			]
			dependencies: ["5E574242513BE343"]
			id: "5BFB2FFADFE2072F"
			tasks: [{
				id: "731C0F983798F22B"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "Breaking Down"
			x: 0.25d
			y: -2.5d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "No Tears, Only Souls"
			description: [
				"&dBandit, by now you've probably collected a lot of junk or trash from the Vaults. "
				""
				"&5Stuff like stone or wood from the POI's you can't do much with, but the stuff inside chests like Wood Chunks can be broken down into a more useful thing : Soul Dust."
				""
				"&dThe Wood Chunks and Ornate Bricks and stuff can be used as some nice decor and building material, but using the Soul Diffusor, you can instead use them to create Soul Shards."
				""
				"&5Meaning, the more you loot from Vaults, the more souls you can get to use in the Black Market."
				""
				"&dJust know that the basic Soul Diffusor is not very fast. There are...upgrades, but those are much more expensive..."
				""
				"&5...and the Soul Diffusor is already a bit pricy at low level."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["10F607F18CE03D39"]
			id: "08E517D3A58B0E81"
