					item: "the_vault:bounty_pearl"
				}
			]
		}
		{
			title: "Sugary Goodness"
			x: 2.25d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Very Crunchy"
			description: [
				"&dMight be a bit early, Bandit, but if you start finding yourself with an excess of Vault Rocks, you can always turn them into Vault Rock Candy."
				""
				"&5Users were complaining that they eventually had chests full of the stuff and wanted other uses for it, so..."
				""
				"&dYou may or may not have noticed, Bandit, but there's a research we snuck in that is...well, a blast from the past."
				""
				"&5The version of Vault Hunters that the FOP uses is the third iteration. There are a few previous iterations that were pretty different."
				""
				"&dSome of these things are still in the code, and we can use that to sneak special things in. Like bringing back Vault Food buffs~"
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["10F607F18CE03D39"]
