		{
			title: "Trial By Plastic"
			x: 0.25d
			y: 0.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Testing Grounds"
			description: [
				"&dAs you level up and get more Skill points for Abilities and Talents, Bandit, you'll start coming up with builds."
				""
				"&5There was no real good way to test these builds, other than with Test Dummies or just going into a normal Vault. So Users complained."
				""
				"&dYep, and the FOP decided to release the Trial Chamber's Vault Rock. It's mostly like a normal Vault Rock you put onto the Vault Altar."
				""
				"&5Except that there is no loot. Not even Soul Shards or Vault XP. Monsters do spawn though."
				""
				"&dYou can test your fighting builds this way. If you die in a Trial Chamber Vault, you shouldn't lose anything."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			dependencies: ["69C663CDD23190A9"]
			id: "159BD132C3F6B884"
