		{
			title: "Altar Needs"
			x: 2.25d
			y: 1.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Altar Greeds"
			description: [
				"&dHey Bandit, I've seeded a special box into the Raw Vault loot pools for you. It's called the Vaultar Box."
				""
				"&5The Vault Altar asks for a lotta things, and it only asks for even more as ye level up."
				""
				"&dSo, to help, I've created a bit of a system loop with the Vaultar Box. This box only contains items the Vault Altar can ask for, even items you haven't hit the level for yet."
				""
				"&5Aye, we have the box pulling from the FOPGame Server's temporary storage of Vault Altar submissions, which come from other Users."
				""
				"&dYep, which gets the Audobon Worm into them and back into the system."
			]
